body:
Despite #4455 this test has been failing intermittently, so let's increase the range a bit to avoid worsening the situation:
```suggestion
            // In principle, "30m" should be correct. However, bad luck in scheduling
            // on shared runners may delay it. Allow a few seconds of skew.
            let possible_values = [
                "30m2s", "30m1s", "30m", "29m59s", "29m58s", "29m57s", "29m56s", "29m55s",
            ];
```
